[clckernel] 🤖 Universal Command recognized by Agent
[clckernel] 🔍 Phase 1: Researching affected layers (Domain -> Infra)
[clckernel] 📝 Phase 2: Authoring local spec in sdds/auth-jwt/spec.md
[clckernel] 👤 Phase 3: Waiting for Architect HITL review... Approved!
[clckernel] 🔴 Phase 4: Writing failing test in test/auth.test.ts (Exit 1)
[clckernel] 🟢 Phase 5: Implementing clean code in src/domain/auth.ts
[clckernel] 🛡️  Phase 6: Running AST audit gate... 0 violations!`,
  },
  {
    id: "step3",
    num: "03",
    name: "Fix Command (TDD)",
    cmd: 'clckernel fix "token expiration returns 500"',
    title: "Surgical Bug Fix with Mandatory Regression Test",
    desc: "Strictly forbids blind 'quick fixes'. Forces the LLM to inspect tracebacks, reproduce the defect with a failing red test, and apply minimal fixes respecting Clean Architecture.",
    output: `$ clckernel fix "token expiration returns 500"
[clckernel] 🤖 Universal Command recognized by Agent
[clckernel] 🔍 Phase 1: Investigating traceback (Zero blind edits)
[clckernel] 🔴 Phase 2: Reproducing with failing test (Exit Code 1)
[clckernel] 🟢 Phase 3: Surgical fix in src/infra/jwt.ts (Clean Arch)
[clckernel] 🛡️  Phase 4: Running audit gate: node tools/audit.js
[clckernel] ✨ Defect fixed cleanly with regression proof!`,
