    desc: "Runs instant AST audits (<5ms via 'clckernel audit') and safely upgrades tools and playbooks ('clckernel update') while 100% preserving your specs (sdds/), custom guards, and .clckernel.yaml.",
    output: `$ clckernel update
[clckernel] 🔄 Upgrading CLC Kernel in repository...
✔ Core AST safeguards refreshed in tools/
✔ Agent skills & playbooks updated in .agents/skills/
